    <li>1.2 - Restricted to full perm inventory items only.</li>
    <li>1.24 - Objects and scripts no longer return their actual UUID but a hash (i.e. pseudo UUID which is consistent with the object/script) instead. -- <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/SVC-3670" target="_blank">SVC-3670</a></li>
  </ul>
